# VHS tape for checkbox label position demo

Output examples/vhs/checkbox_label_position.gif

Set FontSize 20
Set Width 910
Set Height 240
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear && cargo run --release --example checkbox_label_position"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

# Show the demo running
Sleep 3s

# Quit the demo
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
